z73|n|A rope, chain, or rod attached to anything to steady it; as: a rope to steady or guide an object which is being hoisted or lowered; a rope which holds in place the end of a boom, spar, or yard in a ship; a chain or wire rope connecting a suspension bridge with the land on either side to prevent lateral swaying; a rod or rope attached to the top of a structure, as of a derrick, and extending obliquely to the ground, where it is fastened. ; A grotesque effigy, like that of Guy Fawkes, dressed up in England on the fifth of November, the day of the Gunpowder Plot. ; A person of queer looks or dress.	a:a1p,53,5;1gx0,52,64;21vh,47,17;16xm,46,3;w0h,46,7;tei,43,11;6bg,41,3;yo8,41,6;27vq,40,5;ojs,36,2;1pgy,35,13;a26,34,2;1tiv,33,15;2hlh,31,5;198e,30,2~1gx0,52,64;1jjn,10,57;1gv5,12,27;6kc,24,25;3b2,8,23;y7k,1,21;1xvf,3,19;21vh,47,17;1tiv,33,15;1iii,23,14;1pgy,35,13;tei,43,11;8an,17,9;w0h,46,7;1gw9,8,7	V:20p2,42,8;qfe,40,7;23zl,40,4;1g71,37,7;1bqk,27,4;1xo5,25,33;29mi,24,12;jqt,22,6;b50,17,8;1ybo,15,8;18ao,12,3;2428,11,5;1ybk,11,6;5aj,7,7;f7f,3,3~1xo5,25,33;29mi,24,12;b50,17,8;20p2,42,8;1ybo,15,8;qfe,40,7;5aj,7,7;1g71,37,7;jqt,22,6;1ybk,11,6;2428,11,5;1bqk,27,4;23zl,40,4;f7f,3,3;18ao,12,3	n:27vq,54,13;ch2,42,10;udq,31,3;1gx0,30,14;iiq,29,12;200d,24,9;gxj,23,2;1tiv,22,7;15z8,17,6;26d7,9,7;14ik,6,3;1cd7,1,5;28qy,1,2~1gx0,30,14;27vq,54,13;iiq,29,12;ch2,42,10;200d,24,9;1tiv,22,7;26d7,9,7;15z8,17,6;1cd7,1,5;udq,31,3;14ik,6,3;gxj,23,2;28qy,1,2	N:23zl,20,1~23zl,20,1
